---
// A claim and its receipts (spec 009's FR-006, D118). The claim goes in the
// default slot, with a ReceiptMarker in its words, and the Receipts go in the
// "notes" slot. From 64rem wide the notes sit in a margin column beside the
// claim; below that they sit in line, under it. The order in the page is the
// same at every size, so a screen reader and the Tab key meet the claim, then
// its notes.
---

<div class="ds-claim">
  <div class="ds-claim__text">
    <slot />
  </div>
  <div class="ds-claim__notes">
    <slot name="notes" />
  </div>
</div>
